From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: krane <chris@krane.dev>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 23:27:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(settings): drop end4-pC widgets no ported page uses

Port of pctrade/end4-pC dc2ca2600ee6: none (krane-only)
https://github.com/pctrade/end4-pC/tree/dc2ca2600ee6d7852bf0ac91361db8e510f90a74
Problem: ColorSelectionArray, ConfigSelectionShapeArray, LayoutSection and WidgetsMonitorSelector were added for controls the ported pages ended up not using.
Port: krane-only
Drop when: never; these are dead weight until a future page needs them again.
---
 .../common/widgets/ColorSelectionArray.qml    |  98 --------
 .../widgets/ConfigSelectionShapeArray.qml     | 106 ---------
 .../modules/common/widgets/LayoutSection.qml  | 219 ------------------
 .../common/widgets/WidgetsMonitorSelector.qml |  48 ----
 4 files changed, 471 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 dots/.config/quickshell/ii/modules/common/widgets/ColorSelectionArray.qml
 delete mode 100644 dots/.config/quickshell/ii/modules/common/widgets/ConfigSelectionShapeArray.qml
 delete mode 100644 dots/.config/quickshell/ii/modules/common/widgets/LayoutSection.qml
 delete mode 100644 dots/.config/quickshell/ii/modules/common/widgets/WidgetsMonitorSelector.qml

diff --git a/dots/.config/quickshell/ii/modules/common/widgets/ColorSelectionArray.qml b/dots/.config/quickshell/ii/modules/common/widgets/ColorSelectionArray.qml
deleted file mode 100644
index 0af1c8ce..00000000
--- a/dots/.config/quickshell/ii/modules/common/widgets/ColorSelectionArray.qml
